    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">We adopt a systematic approach: each room is tackled individually. Living areas get sturdy boxes for books and electronics, while bedrooms are protected with padded mattress covers and garment bags. We label every box with contents and destination room, and use protective wraps for glass, artwork, and antique furniture.</p>
